SUMMARY:The Peril At Pincer Point
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:A feckless sound recordist is sent to a strange island by a tyr
 annical film director\, but becomes obsessed with the mysteries and litany 
 of eccentrics he discovers there in this constantly inventive\, superbly at
 mospheric British comedy debut. Beautifully shot\, full of wit\, pathos and
  surreal humour\, this is low budget indie filmmaking of the highest order.
